block content
    h1 Arthritis
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/arthritis/symptoms-causes/syc-20350772") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Arthritis is the swelling and tenderness of one or more joints. The main symptoms of arthritis are joint pain and stiffness, which typically worsen with age. The most common types of arthritis are osteoarthritis and rheumatoid arthritis.
